Package: cttiR
Title: CTTIR Project Builder
Version: 0.1.1.9000
Authors@R: person("R.", "Heller", email = "raban.heller@uni-ulm.de", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Creates deterministic research projects from a name, research type
    and goal, routes them to a reviewed standard or specialist workflow, and
    generates a stage library whose package calls are covered by reviewed,
    revision-scoped approvals. Maintains an immutable knowledge catalog of
    package APIs and documentation with verified local, GitHub, CRAN and
    Bioconductor refresh and rollback, a curated resource catalog, grounded
    answers, project synchronization, audits with allowlisted repairs, an
    optional local model runtime and a local Shiny interface.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
Depends: R (>= 4.1.0)
Imports: DBI, RSQLite, digest, fs, httr2, jsonlite, jsonvalidate, processx, ps, uuid, yaml
Suggests: broom, broom.mixed, callr (>= 3.7.0), colorspace, DelayedArray, dplyr,
    ggplot2, knitr, lme4, Matrix, nlme, patchwork, pkgload, png, RColorBrewer, readr,
    renv (>= 1.0.0), rmarkdown, S4Vectors, Seurat, SeuratObject, shiny (>= 1.7.0),
    shinytest2, SingleCellExperiment, SummarizedExperiment, survival, targets,
    testthat (>= 3.2.0), viridisLite, withr
Config/testthat/edition: 3
Roxygen: list(markdown = TRUE)
URL: https://github.com/CTTIR/cttiR
